#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:14
#: c25bfdbaa67648a697389fc0afdd06ae
msgid "Get git"
msgstr "获取 git"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:3 e350a33ef3504821b10877e50b458693
msgid ""
"Git is a free and open source distributed version control system that is "
"used to manage ArduPilot codebase. Git is available on all major OS "
"platforms, and a variety of tools exist to make it easier to get started."
msgstr ""
"git 是一个免费开源的分布式版本控制系统，用于管理 ArduPilot 代码库。git "
"可在所有主流操作系统平台上使用，并且有多种工具可以帮助你快速上手。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:7 1f64796b395c4786924c83fd4914ecb2
msgid "Git command line"
msgstr "git 命令行"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:10 1dc865985c6148e58709fc4fb88c03b1
msgid "Ubuntu"
msgstr "Ubuntu"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:12 3576ea75a80749d8bde8b7f0d3edbfd0
msgid "Linux/Ubuntu users can install with apt :"
msgstr "Linux/Ubuntu 用户可通过 apt 安装："

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:14 5adace8fa04c43e7b074caf7cc5a32ec
msgid "``sudo apt-get update``"
msgstr "``sudo apt-get update``"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:15 bede8fb7033049d88ca386a1bf50244a
msgid "``sudo apt-get install git``"
msgstr "``sudo apt-get install git``"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:16 ff713827aebd45b6bbe6ae858aafb6dd
msgid "``sudo apt-get install gitk git-gui``"
msgstr "``sudo apt-get install gitk git-gui``"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:22 2f68d77e76d94d00a0ca8fb3feb49894
msgid "Windows and other Systems"
msgstr "Windows 及其他系统"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:24 cdffd69d179045f6bd5c46835da3a5ac
msgid ""
"download and install from `git-scm.com's download page <http://git-"
"scm.com/downloads>`__"
msgstr "从 `git-scm.com 下载页面 <http://git-scm.com/downloads>`__ 下载并安装"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:27 a2815129b645498489f1ef99c482c1da
msgid "Recommended GUI Tools"
msgstr "推荐的 GUI 工具"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:29 88e50cf28554419e90df4697a937e612
msgid ""
"The git command line, gitk and git-gui tools are the basics that all "
"users should have installed and are available from a few places."
msgstr "git 命令行、gitk 和 git-gui 是所有用户都应安装的基础工具，可从多个渠道获取。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:31 2d16c45a21e444dca106e2a883a92c81
msgid ""
"A comprehensive list of GUI tools are listed `here on git-scm.com <https"
"://git-scm.com/downloads/guis>`__ but here are a few of the developer "
"favourites:"
msgstr ""
"GUI 工具的完整列表可在 `git-scm.com <https://git-scm.com/downloads/guis>`__ "
"上找到，以下是开发者最喜爱的几款："

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:33 62dc36cc70d442f7be60c8d7e026dc36
msgid ""
"`GitHub Desktop <https://desktop.github.com/>`__ for Windows and Mac is "
"an easy to use tool with good GitHub integration but has fewer features "
"than other clients."
msgstr ""
"适用于 Windows 和 Mac 的 `GitHub Desktop <https://desktop.github.com/>`__ "
"是一款易于使用且与 GitHub 集成良好的工具，但功能比其他客户端少。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:34 511c690396e746e392f661c208b8f708
msgid ""
"`Sourcetree for Windows and Mac OSX <https://www.sourcetreeapp.com/>`__ "
"is a full featured tool with a nice interface with many features "
"including allowing individual lines from a file to be included in a new "
"commit (simpler tools only allow the entire file to be included)"
msgstr ""
"适用于 Windows 和 Mac OSX 的 `Sourcetree <https://www.sourcetreeapp.com/>`__ "
"是一款界面友好、功能丰富的工具，支持将文件中的单独行包含在新提交中（较简单的工具只能包含整个文件）。"

#: ../../source/docs/git-install.rst:35 d8e7aebb9b8d4776872ce3d9b65d5353
msgid ""
"`GitKraken <https://www.gitkraken.com/>`__ is a a full featured tool for "
"Windows, Mac and Linux"
msgstr ""
"`GitKraken <https://www.gitkraken.com/>`__ 是适用于 Windows、Mac 和 Linux "
"的全功能工具。"

