#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:132
#: 4a8e3b6553dd48c29419c6d5a9ffc61b
msgid ""
"To build for an autopilot target on Linux you need the following tools "
"and git repositories:"
msgstr "在 Linux 上为飞控目标构建，需要以下工具和 git 仓库："

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:135
#: bc69cebbd1b64663ad5f3aa6e7e85f5b
msgid ""
"The gcc-arm cross-compiler from `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/STM32-tools/>`__ (ArduPilot is only"
" built and tested on these specific versions of gcc-arm; if installed "
"with ``apt-get`` gcc-arm will not produce a working binary in many cases)"
msgstr ""
"来自 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/STM32-tools/>`__ 的 gcc-arm "
"交叉编译器（ArduPilot 只在这些特定版本的 gcc-arm 上进行构建和测试；通过 ``apt-get`` 安装的 gcc-arm "
"在很多情况下无法生成可用的二进制文件）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:138
#: 22a03e060a0c493f88e9c9b2862444d0
msgid "gnu make, gawk and associated standard Linux build tools"
msgstr "gnu make、gawk 及相关标准 Linux 构建工具"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:139
#: b3f058dd276243b38ad70a6a6341afd5
msgid "On a 64 bit system you will also need to have installed libc6-i386."
msgstr "在 64 位系统上还需要安装 libc6-i386。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:141
#: 2d77011d081742e7bee0236ce47bd47b
msgid ""
"Also, it's worth mentioning here that you want to ensure that the "
"modemmanager package is not installed and the modem-manager process is "
"not running."
msgstr "另外，请确保未安装 modemmanager 包，且 modem-manager 进程未在运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:146
#: 4963c7abaf584b8f8fbc7e82c4ba15be
msgid "Compiler"
msgstr "编译器"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:148
#: ba6e6759994240419decc295e8850996
msgid ""
"You need the specific gcc-arm cross-compiler linked above. You need to "
"unpack it where you want, for now let's call this location TARGET_DIR:"
msgstr "你需要上述链接中特定的 gcc-arm 交叉编译器。需要将其解压到你想要的位置，此处暂称该位置为 TARGET_DIR："

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:155
#: 082dabf28ab84aa3bcea5dafaafc9800
msgid ""
"and then add the bin directory from the tarball to your $PATH by editing "
"the $HOME/.bashrc file and adding a line like this to the end. TARGET_DIR"
" is the location chosen previously where you unpacked the toolchain:"
msgstr ""
"然后通过编辑 $HOME/.bashrc 文件，在末尾添加如下行，将压缩包中的 bin 目录添加到 $PATH。TARGET_DIR "
"是你之前解压工具链的位置："

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:158
#: 911723a72e9a4b31a10a4d2e91b55649
msgid "``export PATH=$PATH:TARGET_DIR/gcc-arm-none-eabi-10-2020-q4-major/bin``"
msgstr "``export PATH=$PATH:TARGET_DIR/gcc-arm-none-eabi-10-2020-q4-major/bin``"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:162
#: 005a7a49e0464dcca10f3911c8028b74
msgid ""
"Versions of ArduPilot before 4.1 must use the following compiler, gcc-"
"arm-none-eabi-6-2017-q2, which can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/STM32-tools/>`__."
msgstr ""
"4.1 版本之前的 ArduPilot 必须使用 gcc-arm-none-eabi-6-2017-q2 编译器，可在 `此处 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/STM32-tools/>`__ 找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:165
#: 36ccbc46b9694f489eca51e33aa06aa1
msgid "Permissions"
msgstr "权限"

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:167
#: cecd023564554d4985892411e07488db
msgid "You need to make your user a member of the dialout group:"
msgstr "需要将你的用户加入 dialout 组："

