#: f8544c167a774359960ed32f74c75426
msgid ""
"Installing *ccache* will speed up your builds a lot. Once you install it "
"(for example with \"sudo apt-get install ccache\") you should link the "
"compiler into /usr/lib/ccache like this:"
msgstr ""
"安装 *ccache* 可以大幅加快构建速度。安装完成后（例如通过「sudo apt-get install ccache」），应将编译器链接到 "
"/usr/lib/ccache，如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/building-setup-linux.rst:192
#: f9f01929ea364b32a6e7d21d7b1ae470
